      "e": 41.66,
      "text": "as well, 5 people in the cabin."
    },
    {
      "s": 41.66,
      "e": 62.06,
      "text": "Flutter to come inside the cabin."
    },
    {
      "s": 62.06,
      "e": 64.06,
      "text": "Connecting, all we took."
    },
    {
      "s": 64.06,
      "e": 65.06,
